# Warehouse components

## The pipeline, left to right

- **Data sources** — OLTP DBs · files & APIs · SaaS apps
- **ETL / ELT** — extract → transform (clean, conform) → load; **staging** holds raw extracts
- **Storage** — the curated warehouse DB — facts & dimensions

## Around it

- **Metadata** — definitions, lineage & catalog — makes it governable
- **Data marts** — departmental subsets *(§05)*
- **Access / BI** — dashboards · ad-hoc / OLAP · data science
